{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Fantasy Trader",
    "steam_appid": 3037460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Experience Fantasy Trader, a passion project crafted over three years by a dedicated indie developer. The game is still in production, so the final product may feature a different UI layout, graphics, and game elements than those currently shown in screenshots.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guide your trading post to riches and fame in a dynamic fantasy world. Build relationships with visiting heroes and address their unique needs and challenges. Defend what\u2019s yours from monsters, thieves, and tax collectors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the owner of a trading post, you can pursue many paths toward wealth, fame, bankruptcy, or even death:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop and leverage 17 different skills, including trade connections, negotiation, leadership, architectural vision, and more. Construct and upgrade over 30 distinct structures to expand your post.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own trading style by sourcing over 300 types of goods from local markets and stocking them in your stores. Capitalize on price fluctuations and a dynamic event system that impacts prices through factors like new taxes, guild and royal politics, wars, and monster invasions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in negotiations with visitors and clients. Want to keep a customer\u2019s interest? Offer them a job? Or perhaps you\u2019d rather share a drink, play a game of dice, or simply chat?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are the local markets lacking interesting goods, or are prices just too high? Try crafting your own products from semi-finished goods\u2014or take your chances on the black market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider hiring mercenaries: save on wages by making vague promises, or build a loyal, well-paid team of soldiers. You could even consider overthrowing the king\u2014after all, who enjoys paying taxes? But be prepared for the consequences\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be an honest merchant or a profit-at-all-costs dealer? Earn a reputation as a trustworthy trader or become known for shady, underhanded dealings. Build the most beautiful trading post in the kingdom, or a fortified fortress adorned with war trophies to deter intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of Fantasy Trader and discover your path.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Experience Fantasy Trader, a passion project crafted over three years by a dedicated indie developer. The game is still in production, so the final product may feature a different UI layout, graphics, and game elements than those currently shown in screenshots.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guide your trading post to riches and fame in a dynamic fantasy world. Build relationships with visiting heroes and address their unique needs and challenges. Defend what\u2019s yours from monsters, thieves, and tax collectors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the owner of a trading post, you can pursue many paths toward wealth, fame, bankruptcy, or even death:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop and leverage 17 different skills, including trade connections, negotiation, leadership, architectural vision, and more. Construct and upgrade over 30 distinct structures to expand your post.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own trading style by sourcing over 300 types of goods from local markets and stocking them in your stores. Capitalize on price fluctuations and a dynamic event system that impacts prices through factors like new taxes, guild and royal politics, wars, and monster invasions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in negotiations with visitors and clients. Want to keep a customer\u2019s interest? Offer them a job? Or perhaps you\u2019d rather share a drink, play a game of dice, or simply chat?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are the local markets lacking interesting goods, or are prices just too high? Try crafting your own products from semi-finished goods\u2014or take your chances on the black market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider hiring mercenaries: save on wages by making vague promises, or build a loyal, well-paid team of soldiers. You could even consider overthrowing the king\u2014after all, who enjoys paying taxes? But be prepared for the consequences\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be an honest merchant or a profit-at-all-costs dealer? Earn a reputation as a trustworthy trader or become known for shady, underhanded dealings. Build the most beautiful trading post in the kingdom, or a fortified fortress adorned with war trophies to deter intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of Fantasy Trader and discover your path.</p>",
